      summary: 'Stukov has multiple playstyles available to him. His Infested units automatically rally to a Psi Emitter he places on the map, providing him with a "set it and forget it" style gameplay. As their lives are timed, they are usually routed to enemy bases and beat the enemy through attrition. He also has Infested Mechanical units, which are a key part of his more advanced gameplay.<br><br>Stukov is an easy commander to play, where even the most simple build can win missions. However, at high levels of play, he lacks in general power level compared to other commanders when it comes to efficiently dealing with certain attack wave types and general damage output.',
